flowchart TD
    A[Raw electrical signal] --> B[Detect cycle boundaries]
    B --> C[Remove startup artifact]
    C --> D[Normalize against device history]
    D --> E[Calculate features]
    E --> F[Compare site and device context]
    F --> G[Estimate state and confidence]
